# Image Icons

Top-level icon images used across the application.

## Power Type Icons (PNG)
Used in the Special Cards table's Icon column (cell display and filter toggles):
- energy.png — yellow atom symbol (Energy)
- combat.png — orange shield/crossed-swords (Combat)
- brute_force.png — green gem/boulder (Brute Force)
- intelligence.png — blue book (Intelligence)
- any-power.png — silver/white circle (Any-Power)

Note: Multi-Power has no dedicated icon yet; falls back to "MP" text.

## Subdirectories
- function/ — white-on-transparent icons for the Function column (offensive, defensive, hourglasses, paperclip, astral)
